h low-risk systems may not require elaborate controls.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"LEGIONELLA_CONTROL_08","direct_score_input":false},{"row":39,"status":"PASS_WITH_LEGIONELLA_CONTROL_09","source":"HSE legionella control","url":"https://www.hse.gov.uk/legionnaires/workplace-risks.htm","verified":"Temperature targets and monitoring frequency depend on system design, occupancy and risk assessment.","quality_score":"3","adoption":"LEGIONELLA_CONTROL_GUARD_09","direct_score_input":false},{"row":40,"status":"PASS_WITH_LEGIONELLA_CONTROL_10","source":"HSE legionella control","url":"https://www.hse.gov.uk/legionnaires/workplace-risks.htm","verified":"Legionella guidance is water-system-specific context and is not an exact parcel-level safety probability.","quality_score":"3","adoption":"LEGIONELLA_CONTROL_GUARD_10","direct_score_input":false}]}